1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,083
Loudness is something different.

2
00:00:02,083 --> 00:00:04,101
It is the sensation in your ear.

3
00:00:04,101 --> 00:00:07,955
It grows with intensity, but not in proportion.

4
00:00:07,955 --> 00:00:20,937
By the Weber Fechner law, the sensation goes as the logarithm of the stimulus: L equals k log I. Ten times the intensity does not sound ten times as loud.

